conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-17T19:47:46-07:00","id":1261224,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sandact6</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1261025-let-s-make-a-flower-of-despair-bloom-spring-razor-green-jade-artifact-4-daiklave?p=1261221#post1261221\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The original in the leak was four dot, so I decided to upgrade it based on that and the ideas I had for it.</div> </div> </div> </div>So this isn't so much correcting the actual published item that is perceived as being at odds with a later book as it is taking a preliminary thing that was dummied out and building something entirely new based on its skeleton?<br /> <br /> Like modding a video game to place the skin of an abandoned concept over an asset that exists elsewhere.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-17T20:47:43-07:00","id":1261235,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1261025-let-s-make-a-flower-of-despair-bloom-spring-razor-green-jade-artifact-4-daiklave?p=1261224#post1261224\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So this isn't so much correcting the actual published item that is perceived as being at odds with a later book as it is taking a preliminary thing that was dummied out and building something entirely new based on its skeleton?<br /> <br /> Like modding a video game to place the skin of an abandoned concept over an asset that exists elsewhere.</div> </div> </div> </div>Kinda yes. A lot of the charms are the same, but I added some new effects in both dissonant/Resonant along with two new charms. I also made some of the charms that gave bigger number upgrades into repurchases to keep it similar.<br /> <br /> A rebalance patch rather than something entirely new.<br /> <br /> The main reason I'm doing this is because they're not going to touch the corebook artifact for legality reasons (AKA: Whomever wrote them, it wasn't Vance and Minton) and content reasons (revamping the old vs something shiny and new)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theo